From a36e76441b5a7c1a30b3461c9537bb3c6aee9d8e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:29:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): flush owned files and export after quiesced
 success

Flush supervisor backing for fsync and fdatasync. After successful root
exit, settle remaining tasks and capture live regular files and directories.
Stage beside the requested host destination and publish a complete, synced,
closed archive without overwrite. Cancel staging on failed workloads.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
